vxwdHh7rw5Ssk3wtdNMfJnXzAQZEWaTeJ+hFSkAPpnVwhL8\nKS+NDK6G04yUAgzYFgrJ68ILqxy5zpQfBoS41KLf0rXS4P1P3tCa7uVG2e8n\nHfeYmFC8RIfDJlSwv0NdXQI1/sDFmyOUdd9Vd0iCL1Vo1BHpc+C/qbHc35RR\n5zCmfZcZx+kRCHnJnuJwH8GobsHOgfIEHmKBkolKfyS8P4/XrX5GTJbNaaRI\nAjH0kgz4d127NY2xZYDP8XinLhOC3hQfJ98OWYVgvAAwNQoLIpa6YoKiiWQJ\nmU9ry6H7Yt6ezZJfcNjiYia+8XTyzVn6FDlhzWjrhjt8IF2p1WnM96uhIJFt\ngvDoSeGlD//7EwC8h56Jm8GU1ZJZY0q03hLpIrMJvH65xqdrIeuoo+x3IN2Z\nYVt/10OSKk8ppBkSEjuZ5xjmn8NXvi0BTLpI4x2AJ0kK5id27iffwgjosD5e\n91T+TSSMTSfTVkws9j9fsEX5rFtpvR3k5Cott4IAudYonK/uOZ6fOn35wIgq\n38H/zWCymQML3jH5QAh6phXFb7ZkgKXDNRvWfcBepRF4+ygvmuoNY1VN8qEK\n3/6nPy6PVB5jU5yxhnYrG5OUMmXjSsIlW2/gRYggOTrS3adJ5tVrQVkxyOG0\njJHXNG0x1B+AWUI/lyhjBefkKdNOBlqapoDor/h0GZH7\n",
    "long_instructions": "# Lists of Objects\r\n\r\n1.  **PROMPT (Generate Data)**\r\n    * Ask AI: *\"Generate an array of 5 objects for school supplies (id, name, location, isAvailable).\"*\r\n    * Paste the array into the empty `supplies` variable.\r\n\r\n2.  **ANALYZE (Verify)**\r\n    * Look at the structure of the array of objects.\r\n    * As AI questions you are wondering about. For example, “What do the brackets and braces mean?”\r\n\r\n3.  **INTEGRATE**\r\n\t* **Get Item**\r\n    \t* In `getItemByIndex`, write code to return `supplies[index]`.\r\n    \t* *Challenge:* Return `null` if the index is invalid (< 0 or too high).\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n::: details [**🔎 Feeling stuck? Show me how.**]\r\n![](https://images.code.org/d6df6b77273f9067ddc00b6dbddf5c07-image-1766165351780.png)\r\n*To make code larger, adjust the instructions panel.*\r\n:::\r\n\r\n---\r\n4. **Update Item**\r\n    \t* In `updateLocationByIndex`, get the item using your function.\r\n    \t* If the item exists, update `item.location`.\r\n    * **Test:** Use the \"Update\" panel, then verify the change using \"Check Supply\".\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n::: details [**🔎 Feeling stuck? Show me how.**]\r\n![](https://images.code.org/40ef1e285a1be878be892c87a53c64a6-image-1766165600004.png)\r\n*To make code larger, adjust the instructions panel.*\r\n:::\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n5. **REFLECT**\r\n\t* In `reflection.md` respond to the question: \"What pattern do you notice in each object?\r\n"
  },
